Package: udb
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, apt, bash (>= 4.4), ca-certificates, curl, procps, python3 (>= 3.10), sudo
Description: Ubuntu development-environment initializer
 Initialize an Ubuntu development environment on a standalone system or WSL2.
 Existing compatible tools and user configuration are preserved, and task
 failures include individual recovery commands.
 .
 Package installation only installs the command and documentation. Run udb
 separately as an ordinary user to initialize the host; initialization can
 upgrade packages and change system configuration.
